# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Generated App Store captures and upload-ready artwork. The deterministic
# sources live in tool/store_assets; CI publishes the rendered files as an
# artifact so large PNGs never bloat the Git history.
/store_assets/raw/
/store_assets/output/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
